{
 "name": "campaign_step_cache",
 "description": "Step caching: FBCache (PR 11713, CUDA graph kept) vs static step skip (PR 11737 image, 11748 video; transformer_cache=static, schedule from UNSLOTH_STATIC_SKIP_MODE/HEAD/TAIL/EVERY, defaults taylor1 / 0.2 / 0.1 / 2, only at >= 12 steps) on Qwen-Image-2.1 (1024, 25 and 40 steps, CFG 1) and Wan2.2-TI2V-5B (832x480x49, 50 steps, family-default guidance, the video_static_e2e grid), stacked on int8 / fp8. Diffusers never resets FBCache residuals between generations, so a harness that does not reset them overstates FBCache; Studio's backend must (check transformer_cache_stats per render). Assert engagement on every cache cell: status.transformer_cache must name the mode and transformer_cache_stats must show skipped calls (the T2 all-opt Studio cell reported fbcache but it never engaged). zimg_static_below_min is a lever-refusal check (Z-Image-Turbo's 9 steps are under STATIC_MIN_STEPS=12): it should render identically to zimg_off_9 and report static as not applied. Needs a Studio tree with PR 11737 / 11748: unsloth main at 168961def (2026-09-23) has no static mode and refuses the cells (BROKEN: Unsupported transformer_cache 'static'), which is the right outcome there. Studio vs ComfyUI with EasyCache lives in specs/compare_qwen21_allopt.json (T2 tier); not duplicated here.",
